OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785676707
OL,3,CMissing child dies after being found
OL,4,Cin water
OL,6,FA missing child has died after being
OL,7,Ffound in a body of water in
OL,8,FWorcestershire.
OL,10,FWest Mercia Police said officers
OL,11,Fresponded to reports of a missing
OL,12,Fchild in Badsey, on July 29th.
OL,14,FParamedics were called at 6.50pm, and
OL,15,Fthey sent an ambulance and air
OL,16,Fambulance to the scene.
OL,18,FThe child was found unresponsive in
OL,19,Fthe water and a short time later was
OL,20,Fpronounced dead.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/4
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
