OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785676707
OL,3,CMissing child dies after being found
OL,4,Cin water
OL,6,FThe force called it "an incredibly
OL,7,Ftragic incident".
OL,9,FThey added there was no third-party
OL,10,Finvolvement in the child's death.
OL,12,FA West Mercia Police spokesperson
OL,13,Fsaid: "Officers were called to a
OL,14,Freport of a missing child in Badsey
OL,15,Fyesterday evening (Wednesday 29 July).
OL,17,F"Sadly, the child was found
OL,18,Funresponsive in a body of water, and a
OL,19,Fshort time later was pronounced dead.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/4
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785676707
OL,3,CMissing child dies after being found
OL,4,Cin water
OL,6,F"There is no third-party involvement
OL,7,Fin the child's death, and a report
OL,8,Fwill be prepared for the coroner.
OL,10,F"This is an incredibly tragic incident.
OL,12,F"We ask the public to avoid
OL,13,Fspeculation online as this is
OL,14,Fincredibly distressing to the family
OL,15,Fand we ask that their privacy is
OL,16,Frespected at such a difficult time."
OL,18,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said:
OL,19,F"We were called reports of an incident
OL,20,Fin Badsey at 6.50pm yesterday
OL,21,F(Wednesday).
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/4
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785676707
OL,3,CMissing child dies after being found
OL,4,Cin water
OL,6,F"One ambulance, two paramedic officers
OL,7,Fand the Midlands Air Ambulance
OL,8,FCritical Care Car attended the scene.
OL,10,F"On arrival we discovered one patient,
OL,11,Fa young child.
OL,13,F"Ambulance staff and police worked
OL,14,Fquickly to treat the patient, but
OL,15,Fsadly, it became apparent nothing
OL,16,Fcould be done to save them and they
OL,17,Fwere confirmed dead at the scene."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/4
